{
  "id": "E381",
  "title": "“The Dictating Party”",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-11-22",
  "synopsis": "In Chinese business cooperations, the entrusting party of an agreement is sometimes informally called “dad\". They’re the ones paying, so they have the final say in everything.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50381/3856034be045001f6d415fb7daaa3de81c7a63ff.mp3?1573478571",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "“甲方爸爸”\n\n小何：你的方案给客户发过去了吗？\n小张：还在改，今天晚上肯定要加班了。\n小何：你不是都做好了吗，怎么又要改？\n小张：我昨天晚上给客户发过去了，但是今天早上收到邮件，他们又提出了三条修改意见。\n小何：你已经修改了不下十次了吧。\n小张：十二次了！\n小何：碰到这样的客户真是心累。\n小张：没办法，谁让他们是“甲方爸爸”呢！",
    "traditional": "“甲方爸爸”\n\n小何：你的方案給客戶發過去了嗎？\n小張：還在改，今天晚上肯定要加班了。\n小何：你不是都做好了嗎，怎麼又要改？\n小張：我昨天晚上給客戶發過去了，但是今天早上收到郵件，他們又提出了三條修改意見。\n小何：你已經修改了不下十次了吧。\n小張：十二次了！\n小何：碰到這樣的客戶真是心累。\n小張：沒辦法，誰讓他們是“甲方爸爸”呢！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“The Dictating Party”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：你的方案给客户发过去了吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：你的方案給客戶發過去了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ de fāng àn gěi kè hù fā guò qu le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Have you sent your proposal to the client?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：还在改，今天晚上肯定要加班了。",
      "traditional": "小張：還在改，今天晚上肯定要加班了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hái zài gǎi jīn tiān wǎn shang kěn dìng yào jiā bān le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I’m still correcting it. I definitely have to work overtime tonight."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：你不是都做好了吗，怎么又要改？",
      "traditional": "小何：你不是都做好了嗎，怎麼又要改？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ bú shì dōu zuò hǎo le ma zěn me yòu yào gǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Didn’t you finish it already? Why are you changing it again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：我昨天晚上给客户发过去了，",
      "traditional": "小張：我昨天晚上給客戶發過去了，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ zuó tiān wǎn shang gěi kè hù fā guò qu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "但是今天早上收到邮件，他们又提出了三条修改意见。",
      "traditional": "但是今天早上收到郵件，他們又提出了三條修改意見。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì jīn tiān zǎo shang shōu dào yóu jiàn tā men yòu tí chū le sān tiáo xiū gǎi yì jiàn",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I sent the proposal to the client yesterday evening."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But I received an email this morning, and they suggested another three amendment ideas."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小何：你已经修改了不下十次了吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：你已經修改了不下十次了吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ yǐ jīng xiū gǎi le bú xià shí cì le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: You’ve already amended it no less than 10 times!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小张：十二次了！",
      "traditional": "小張：十二次了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shí èr cì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: 12 times!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小何：碰到这样的客户真是心累。",
      "traditional": "小何：碰到這樣的客戶真是心累。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé pèng dào zhè yàng de kè hù zhēn shì xīn lèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: It’s really wearing on the mind to come across this kind of client."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小张：没办法，谁让他们是“甲方爸爸”呢！",
      "traditional": "小張：沒辦法，誰讓他們是“甲方爸爸”呢！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng méi bàn fǎ shéi ràng tā men shì jiǎ fāng bà ba ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: There’s nothing to be done. Who let them be “The Dictating Party”!"
    }
  ],
