    "sentence_translations": [
      "“The Dictating Party”",
      "",
      "Little He: Have you sent your proposal to the client?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: I’m still correcting it. I definitely have to work overtime tonight.",
      "",
      "Little He: Didn’t you finish it already? Why are you changing it again?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: I sent the proposal to the client yesterday evening.",
      "But I received an email this morning, and they suggested another three amendment ideas.",
      "",
      "Little He: You’ve already amended it no less than 10 times!",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: 12 times!",
      "",
      "Little He: It’s really wearing on the mind to come across this kind of client.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: There’s nothing to be done. Who let them be “The Dictating Party”!",
      ""
